    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardist Party is an online multiplayer party game designed exclusively for 4 players.<br>Note: A full group of 4 players is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Board Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main elements are dice rolling and cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388290/extras/20efc09235249d28e79ebfb87bf46fd3.avif?t=1734159161\" data-has-big width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Condition<br>At the end of the final turn, add up the number of spaces you\u2019ve landed on during the game and the bonus points from your hand (the number in the top-left corner of each card).<br>The player with the highest total score wins.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What You Can Do During Your Turn<br>At the start of your turn, draw one card and roll the dice.<br>Move forward based on the number rolled.<br>After moving, you can play up to two cards from your hand.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games<br>Once everyone has taken their turn, a mini-game begins. After the mini-game, each player receives one card.<br>The strength of the card you receive depends on your ranking in the mini-game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes:<br>\u30fbBoard game<br>\u30fbMini-game battle<br>\u30fbMini-game free play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 30 types of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable board game rules:<br>Adjust turn count, toggle mini-games, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 13 mini-games</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cardist Party is an online multiplayer party game designed exclusively for 4 players.<br>Note: A full group of 4 players is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Board Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main elements are dice rolling and cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388290/extras/20efc09235249d28e79ebfb87bf46fd3.avif?t=1734159161\" data-has-big width=800 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory Condition<br>At the end of the final turn, add up the number of spaces you\u2019ve landed on during the game and the bonus points from your hand (the number in the top-left corner of each card).<br>The player with the highest total score wins.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What You Can Do During Your Turn<br>At the start of your turn, draw one card and roll the dice.<br>Move forward based on the number rolled.<br>After moving, you can play up to two cards from your hand.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games<br>Once everyone has taken their turn, a mini-game begins. After the mini-game, each player receives one card.<br>The strength of the card you receive depends on your ranking in the mini-game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes:<br>\u30fbBoard game<br>\u30fbMini-game battle<br>\u30fbMini-game free play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 30 types of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable board game rules:<br>Adjust turn count, toggle mini-games, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 13 mini-games</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A casual card-based board game meets chaotic, action-packed mini-games for endless fun! An online party game for four players\u2014get ready to laugh out loud with your friends!",
